GIMP Palette
Name: SRD Combat Master
Columns: 4
# Master palette for SRD_Combat sprite art, 64px nominal stature.
# Built to sit beside the installed packs: body midtones V 0.25-0.50 / S 0.30-0.50,
# hue-shifted ramps (shadows cool, lights warm), outlines hue-tinted near-black,
# highlights V 0.85+ reserved for focal edges. Each row of 4 is one material ramp,
# shadow -> light. Pick 3-4 ramps + 1 accent per sprite (12-20 colors); the whole
# palette is a menu, not a per-sprite budget.
